* OPA2134 FET-input audio dual op-amp, ±18 V max (our model from TI's sheet)
* Built by Solum Builder from TI OPAx134 data sheet SBOS058B (revised November 2024), at ±15 V (D-162)
.subckt OPA2134 1 2 3 4 5
* pins: + - V+ V- out. Built by Solum Builder from the sheet's typical figures (D-162)
Rin 1 2 1e+12
Rc1 1 mid 1e12
Rc2 2 mid 1e12
Emid mid 4 3 4 0.5
Bgm mid g I=1e-05*tanh(3.55431*(V(1)-V(2)))
R1 g mid 2.81349e+10
C1 g mid 5e-13
Vhp 3 hp DC 1.1
Vhn hn 4 DC 0.4
Dhi g hp DCLAMP
Dlo hn g DCLAMP
Ebuf b 0 g 0 1
Rp b p 1000
Cp p 0 1.98944e-11
Eout o 0 p 0 1
Vsense o o2 0
Rout o2 5 10
Bsrc 3 0 I=max(i(Vsense),0)
Bsnk 0 4 I=max(-i(Vsense),0)
Iq 3 4 DC 0.004
.model DCLAMP D(is=1e-15 n=0.05)
.ends
